    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p>Spend <strong>1 Resonance Die</strong> and open the Resonance Channel dialog.</p><ul><li><p>+1 Resolve DC</p></li><li><p>Add one additional damage/effect die</p></li><li><p>Extend duration one step</p></li><li><p>Impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on one save</p></li><li><p>Stabilize against counters / dispels</p></li></ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"clResChanAct\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Resonance Channel (Spend)</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/round (gain)  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Free (with manifestation)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Spend 1 Resonance Die and pick one channel: +1 Resolve DC · add an extra damage/effect die · extend duration one step · impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on one defense · stabilize against counter/dispel.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
